  "question": {
    "text": "If the function $f(x)=2 x^3-9 \\mathrm{ax}^2+12 \\mathrm{a}^2 \\mathrm{x}+1$, where $\\mathrm{a} \\gt 0$, attains its local maximum and local minimum values at $p$ and $q$, respectively, such that $\\mathrm{p}^2=\\mathrm{q}$, then $f(3)$ is equal to:",
