  "solution": {
    "text": "$f^{\\prime}(x)=6 x^2-18 a x+12 a^2$<br/>$f^{\\prime}(x)=6\\left(x^2-3 a x+2 a^2\\right)$<br/>roots are $a, 2 a$<br/>$\\mathrm{p}^2=\\mathrm{q} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a}^2=2 \\mathrm{a}$<br/>$a=2$<br/>$f(x)=2 x^3-18 x^2+48 x+1$<br/>$f(3)=37$",
